window.products.push({"id":89007,"name":"Premier 1 Supplies Borotto Sirio Humidity Pump","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cLUb2dBkL._AC_.jpg","description":"No need to open the incubator to check humidity or water levels. All can performed by this pump and sensor externally. During incubation, embryos need natural water vapor, not mist created by an ultrasonic frequency. The SIRIO automatic humidifier allows water to be introduced into the incubator using natural evaporation, with no input from the operator. All the user needs to do is periodically top off the reservoir. Often, conventional pumps have limescale problems and become blocked. With the SIRIO, humidity is produced by direct evaporation of the water. As a result, the vapor will not leave limescale deposits on the eggshell. For successful hatching, it is recommended to keep the incubator in residential premises, not in sheds, porches or garages. The room temperature should ideally be between 68°F and 77°F and draft free. The room must be well ventilated and comfortable. Ensure the incubator is not exposed to direct sunlight or placed close to heat sources such as radiators, stoves, fireplaces, boilers etc. The room’s relative humidity must be between 50% and 75%.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cLUb2dBkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premier 1 Supplies","source_asin":"B09JJ2BW18","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JJ2BW18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JJ2BW18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
