window.products.push({"id":89268,"name":"wirsh Ice Maker- Countertop Ice Machine with Two Ice Cube Sizes, Countertop Ice Maker with LED Lights, Make 26lbs Ice in 24 Hours, 9 Cubes Ready in 7 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j+hkQbo9S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Most Compact Ice Machine: With a size of 8.1x 12.0 x 11.5 inch, this countertop ice machine is compact enough for most countertops and easy to carry with, which can work anywhere there is a standard electrical outlet to plug it in. It is very useful for picnics, camping, and outdoor parties. Perfect for the boat, small kitchen, restrooms, bars, office, and more. Also, this Portable Ice Machine is designed in a sleek black coated finish to go with virtually any kitchen or breakroom style. Two sizes ice selectable & Self Cleaning :The Wirsh countertop Ice Maker comes with two ice bullets size selectable: Small and Large which is great for cold drinks or cooling foods. Furthermore, You Don’t need worry about the cleaning after you use it. Just hold the POWER button for 3 seconds the ice maker machine will automatically clean the interior. When self-cleaning is complete, the device will automatically switches to standby mode. Efficient Ice Maker – Although it's a portable ice machine, it has a high-capacity ice tank which is combined of ice scoop and removable ice basket. Once the machine is plugged in, it will begin to reduce temperature to make ice. You will be amazed at its fast speed. Moreover, the Wirsh Countertop Ice maker is equipped with a high efficiency compressor that requires low energy to keep the ice cool, save your time, energy and money. Rapid Ice Making: The Wirsh ice maker can produce 9 ice cubes in as little as 7 minutes, so you don’t have to wait for a long time before you can put the ice cubes into drinks. Keep the 1.6-quart water tank filled and this unit can even make up to 26 lbs. of bullet-shaped ice cubes in a 24 hour period - enough to keep drinks cold all day long. Simple and Safe: Our ice maker is simple to use with simple control panel, LED lights and full large clear viewing window. The button on the electronic control panel lets you turn it on /off and select the size of ice cube; the indicator lights up when the ice basket is full or you need to add more water. This ice cube maker is made from food safety grade materials, which can offer healthy ice cubes for you, ensuring the safety of drinking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j+hkQbo9S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wirsh","source_asin":"B088M8KQPN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088M8KQPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088M8KQPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
