window.products.push({"id":89299,"name":"Swift Green Filters (1 Pack) Swift Sgf-Bo52 Refrigerator Water Filter, 2 In Dia X 8-1/4 In L, 0.5 µm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6110e30pAhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Replacement for BOSCH 640565 (CUNO CS-52). We aim to provide you with the cleanest and healthiest water filtration for your home and business by making sure the materials we use in our products are environmentally conscious while being cost effective. We are the green alternative to the conventional filter. Our activated carbon is produced using a new technology that carbonizes dried coconut shells in an enclosed self-sustaining system. This process captures and converts the emissions into useful thermal energy. We offer a variety of filters that are compatible with all leading brand refrigerators. Coconuts are a renewable and sustainable source of charcoal. Grown in over 80 countries, coconuts have a total production of 61 million tons per year. All those husks are being tossed or burned as waste. We take those husks and use them to create the charcoal for our carbon filters. Coconut carbon is superior to other sources of activated carbon. It has 50% more micro-pores for capturing contaminants. For more information please visit the Swift Green Website . Swift Green Filters SGF-BO52 Refrigerator Water Filter made in USA and Canada REPLACEMENT FOR: Bosch/ CunoOCS: 640565, 1257074, 5586605, 55866-05, 55866-06, 640565, AP3961137, B20CS5, B20CS8, CS-452, CS-52, CS52, EVOLFLTR10, EVOLFLTION500 SERIES, B20CS50SN, EVOLFLTION800 SERIES, B20CS80SN • Reduces chlorine taste • Reduces sediment, dirt and rust • Reduces lead, mercury, cysts and turbidity up to 99% • Filter Capacity VOC: 300 gallons • Filter Capacity CTO: 2000 gallons • Change Frequency: 6 months • Flow Rate: 0.5 gpm • Operating Pressure: 20-100 psi • Temperature Rating: 33-100° F • Filter Applications: Sediment, dirt and rust, chlorine taste and odor, lead, cysts, turbidity, asbestos, atrazine, mercury • Filter Media: Coconut Shell Carbon Block • Certification: WQA Gold Seal, meets NSF Standard 42. From the Manufacturer Swift Green Filters is the green alternative in water filtration. We think that sustainability should be at the forefront of every business model. Our unique carbonization process reduces harmful impurities while improving the quality of your drinking water. We offer a variety of refrigerator and food service filter replacements. Our products are 100% recyclable and all materials used in our products are NSF, UL and Gold Seal certified.  You can recycle your used filter by shipping it back to us! We are proud to say all our products are made within North America.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6110e30pAhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swift Green Filters","source_asin":"B00EDI8FXE","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EDI8FXE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EDI8FXE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
