window.products.push({"id":89327,"name":"4 Reusable K Cups for Keurig K Supreme, K Supreme Plus and K Slim with Multistream Technology - 4 Black Refillable Kcups Coffee Filters for Keurig Cof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H64zKz7dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET OF 4 K-CUPS – Get a cup of coffee ready for yourself in a Reusable K Cup filter, transfer the coffee in another cup, wash the Keurig cup and prepare another flavour of a guest’s choice. Continue the process until you have satisfied the cravings of all the guests or family members with widely different choices. Or be smart & buy a set of 4 reusable k cups to prepare one cup (different coffees) after another, without the need for any transition or cleanups in between. COMPATIBILITY – Goodcups k cup filters are unconditionally compatible with Keurig K Supreme, Keurig K Supreme Plus, Keurig K Slim with Multistream Technology and do not require any hacks. MICRO MESH TECHNOLOGY FOR SUPERIOR BREW – Our Keurig reusable k cup filters are made up of superior quality stainless steel micro-mesh which is engineered to ensure an optimum flow rate of water through the coffee – this helps extract maximum flavours from your coffee. Moreover, the food-grade stainless steel is non-reactive and doesn’t alter the taste or aroma of your expensive coffee in any way. DURABLE DESIGN THAT’S ECO-FRIENDLY – Goodcups Keurig 2.0 k cup reusable coffee filters are a far superior choice to paper filters as they do not have to be disposed of after every use and each Reusable k cup is expected to make thousands of coffees. This also means that our filters prove to be more cost-effective in the long run. Besides this, my reusable k cups have a unibody construction to ensure that the lid doesn’t break like the way it does in case of cheaper options. 100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE We offer you a 100% risk-free satisfaction guarantee to let you buy with confidence; no questions asked. However, we are quite sure that you will be super impressed with the functional effectiveness, quality, the ease with which the different flavours of coffee can be prepared one after another, and the breeze with which each filter can be cleaned.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H64zKz7dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoodCups","source_asin":"B0C89J23ZB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C89J23ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C89J23ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":89328,"name":"Waterdrop Plus XWF Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® XWF (WR17X30702) NSF 401&53&42 Certified, 3 Filters (Package may vary)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712YPvnMs8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement for models: GE XWF, WR17X30702, GBE21, GDE21, GDE25, GFE24, GFE26, GNE21, GNE25, GNE27, GYE18, QNE27, GSE25, GSS23, GSS25, GZS22, PSE25, CZS22, GNE27JSMSS, GNE27JMMES, GNE27ESMSS, GNE27JGMBB, GNE27JGMWW, GSE23, GSE23G, GSE26, CFE26, XFE26, CWE19, Maxblue MB-F48, AQUACREST AQF-FF48, FilterLogic FL-RF48, WS648A, Crystala CF9, Pureza PF9, Glacier Fresh GF-XWF. Note: Only XWF! This filter is replacement for XWF! The Waterdrop brand is tried and trusted by more than 6 million US families to provide them with purer, cleaner, safer drinking water. We provide only high quality replacement filters that are certified as reducing a wide range of impurities by NSF 401, 53, 42 and 372. Comprehensive certification: This Waterdrop WDP-F48 replacement water filter is comprehensively certified by NSF and IAPMO against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 &372 Standards test from each component to the filter cartridge as a whole to achieve a supreme filtration performance. This filter has been strictly certified by NSF 401 to reduce phenytoin, ibuprofen, naproxen, estrone and bisphenol A. Asides it has also been tested according to NSF/ANSI 53 standards to reduce lead, benzene, mercury, PFOA&PFOS. Deep filtration: Waterdrop's refrigerator filters significantly reduce the levels of many different harmful substances in your water. The filter additionally allows through many of the beneficial minerals in water that are essential for health. Fast water flow, no leaks: Our mission is to supply refrigerator water filters that fit perfectly, impeccably engineered; this sets us apart from inferior models of replacement filters that can frequently result in water leakage problems. The microscopic pore sizes in our filter cartridges, made of superior materials, allow for smooth running, crisp, pure water. Waterdrop uses coconut shell carbon blocks supplied from Sri Lanka that have enlarged surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon blocks. The filter cartridge is far more effective in reducing levels of chlorine, dirt, sediment, rust, and a wide range of heavy metals tested by a third-party laboratory. In line with our high level of attention to detail, we have chosen a BPA-free and food-grade housing for the filter that exceeds the NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. Regular filter changes: If you run replacement filter past the recommended date, something could accumulate and filtration performance could suffer. Because of this, we supply a complimentary set of installation stickers with every filter so that you can see at a glance when it needs replacing. We recommend that you should replace your filter after it has been used for 3200 cups of water (200 gallons) or 6 months (this may vary dependent on the water condition in your area). Professional standards: Our expert teams pride themselves on not letting any product or part of a product, down to the smallest components, leave our factory unless we are satisfied that they have reached and exceeded the very highest market standards. Our dedication doesn't just apply within the factory: we have a customer service team ready to answer your questions and deal with any problems 24/7. More than just a business: Waterdrop is passionate about providing clean water for as many people as possible with lower environmental impact. We use cowhide corrugated box packaging, reducing the wastage other companies create with their materials. A percentage of the purchase price from every one of our filters is used to fund projects providing clean, pure water for African children who don't have access to safe water supplies. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712YPvnMs8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B08Z3DYM25","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3DYM25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3DYM25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
