window.products.push({"id":89340,"name":"WE49X20697 WE3M26 Dryer Bearing Kit by Techecook - Replacement for GE Hotpoint Dryer - Package Includes WE3M26 Top Bearing WE1M504 WE1M1067 Drum Slide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KwnvuULwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【DRYER BEARING KIT】---WE3M26 WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Kit allows the front of the drum to glide smoothly on the felt seal of the front panel when the drum is rotating. The front drum support bearing is also called the drum glide bearing, the front drum bearing attaches onto the inside of the dryer front panel. WE3M26 Dryer Bearing Kit is made of durable and high quality material, so that the dryer smooth operation, prolong its life. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】---Including 1 x WE3M26 top front bearing, 1 x WE12M29 dryer belt, 1 x WE09X20441(WE9M30) dryer felt seal, 2 x WE1M504 White Drum Slides, 2 x WE1M1067 Drum Slides. Installation is simple, to complete the installation of WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Kit, you need a Phillips screwdriver. Disconnect and unplug the dryer before performing any repairs and wear work gloves to protect your hands. ✅【COMPATIBLE MODEL】---Techecook WE3M26 Drum Front Bearing Kit compatible with G-E Hot-point Dryer. ►Replacement part: WE49X20697, 3319945, AP5806906, EAP9493092, PS9493092, DVLR223EE1WW, DPSE810EG0WT, DPSE810EG4WT, GTDX180ED0WW, GTDX180ED1WW, GTDX180ED2WW, GTDX180ED3WW, GTDX180ED4WW, GTDX180ED5WW, GTDX180ED6WW, GTDP180ED0WW, GTDP180ED1WW, DWSR463GG0WW, DPSR610EG0WT, DPSR610EG1WT, DPSR610EG2WT, DPSR610EG3WT, DPSR610EG4WT, etc. ✅【FIXES THE SYMPTOMS】---WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Kit can fixes the following symptoms: ①Make lots of Noisy or squeak ②Will not tumble ③Marks left on clothes ④Takes too long to dry. If any of the above problems occur with your clothes dryer, you can replace it with new WE49X20697 Dryer Front Bearing Kit for G-E to restore the dryer to its best working level. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】---During the 365 DAYS WARRANTY period, if the WE3M26 Drum Front Bearing Kit has any quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Risk-free shopping, Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. We will try our best to solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KwnvuULwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08RJ83RT5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RJ83RT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RJ83RT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
