window.products.push({"id":89352,"name":"Deco Chef 15-Inch Under Counter Beverage Cooler for Beer, Wine, Sodas, 115 Can Capacity, Digital Touch Temperature Control, Even Forced Air Cooling, 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WK5P7RgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL BEVERAGES WHEN YOU WANT THEM - The Deco Chef 15” Under Counter Beverage Cooler is the perfect solution for your home bar, rec room, den, or office. With a beautiful stainless steel finish, keep sodas, beers, wine, and more to the ideal temperature best for serving and enjoying. PURPOSE BUILT - More than just a mini fridge, the refrigerator unit is designed specifically for cans and bottles. Keep up to 115 12 oz. cans cool and ready for enjoyment. Store wine bottles at their ideal serving temperature, and most importantly all of these are kept handy and out of the way under the counter. DESIGNED FOR THE ENTHUSIAST - Included must-have options such as touch temperature control and a clear viewing window so you can make your selections without opening the door. A built-in light keeps drinks illuminated when choosing drink options at night, or if you just like to show off your prized collection. THE SPECS - Using CFC Free forced air cooling, get an even temperature throughout the unit, so nothing gets too cold or too hot. Six wire shelves allow you to store how you like, mixing cans, bottles, and more with ease. Choose temperatures from 35.6 °F to 60.8 °F depending on what you’re storing - you have full control! INSTALL WHERE YOU WANT IT - Install directly under your countertop (dimensions permitting) without worry thanks to the front ventilation design - this ensures the unit has proper airflow and won’t overheat. Don’t want to use this under a counter? Perfectly ok! This can also serve as a free-standing unit should you have the need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WK5P7RgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco Chef","source_asin":"B09HWLVW4P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HWLVW4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HWLVW4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
