window.products.push({"id":89389,"name":"COSTWAY Portable Washing Machine, 8Lbs Capacity Full-automatic Washer with 6 Wash Programs, LED Display, 3 Water Levels, Compact Laundry Washer and Dr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eXHyqoQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧺【2-in-1 Full Automatic Technology】: This full automatic washing machine can make your laundry work much easier. You just need to set the washing/spinning program and then it will work alone. The stainless steel inner tub with honeycomb design simulates the hand washing effect and prevents the clothes from getting intertwined. 🧺【6 Programs & 3 Water Levels】: The clear button control panel and LED display make the operation very easy for everyone. What's more, 6 laundry programs and 3 water levels offer various choices for you to deal with different kinds and amounts of clothes. The power supply will automatically shut off when the washing is finished or there is no operation in 10 mins after pressing the power button. 🧺【Compact Design & Large Capacity】: This lightweight one-tub washing machine with a compact size of 17\" x 17\" x 29.5\" (L x W x H) won't take up much floor space and is easy to move it. In addition, the large stainless steel inner tub can hold up to 8 lbs of clothes at one time, which can meet all the laundry needs of your family. 🧺【Convenient Drainage & Imbalance Adjustment】: This full automatic washing machine comes with a built-in drain pump and an extended 79\" drain hose to drain dirty water easily and effectively. Moreover, when the laundry in the tub is placed unevenly during spinning, the washing machine will detect and adjust imbalance automatically to avoid any annoying vibration. 🧺【User-friendly Design & Wide Application】: The transparent visible top lid makes it convenient for you to see the washing status at any time. The embedded handles on both sides help to hold and move the washer easily. This portable and full-automatic washing machine is a perfect choice for dorms, apartments, condos, RV’s, camping, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eXHyqoQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0BBQ69PWX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBQ69PWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBQ69PWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
