window.products.push({"id":89507,"name":"EVERYTHRY Dryer Heating Element DC47-00019A for Samsung Dryer, Thermal Fuse DC96-00887A and DC47-00016A, Thermistor DC32-00007A, Thermostat DC47-00018","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtbkSh9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why does your dryer can not produce any heat or not enough heat? Perhaps your heater assembly has ended its life or breaks. In this condition, you need to replace them. Before replacing the samsung dryer heater element, PLEASE do these things first: 1. Remember to unplug the power source before starting the maintenance. 2. Wear the insulated gloves to protect your hands. 3. Clean up the accumulation of the heating unit ventilation and the bottom of the dryer. The accumulated debris may be a potential fire hazard. 4. Suggest you take photos before disassembling each piece,especially the wires. 5. If you are not sure if the heating wire is good. You can use an ohmmeter or multimeter to test the heating element. A good heating element should show about 9-10 ohms. A burnt element has very large ohms. Or, if the heating wire breaks, also needs to be replaced. 6. There are a lots of installation videos on YouTube that can help you install better. Packages list: 1 x DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element1 x DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse1 x DC96-00887A Thermal Fuse1 x DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor1 x DC47-00018A Thermostat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtbkSh9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVERYTHRY","source_asin":"B08DXQW4NK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DXQW4NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DXQW4NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
