window.products.push({"id":89575,"name":"4 Pack 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse Replacement Part for Whirlpool Maytag Kenmore Dryers, 3388651, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP (4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410MaAauwdL._AC_.jpg","description":"3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse Replacement part for Whirlpool & Kenmore Dryers. The 3392519 dryer thermal fuse is used in dryers as a safety mechanism that stops the flow of electricity to the motor circuit when a dryer overheats. This replacement part features two 3/16 inch terminals, and is sold individually. When this fuse is faulty, your dryer will not start or it will not heat properly. This is a one-time fuse, meaning it cannot be re-set. It must be replaced when there is no longer continuity between the terminals. It attaches to the blower wheel housing. Blown fuses can be caused by clogged dryer vents. We recommend checking to make sure all of the vents are clear when you perform this repair. You can choose 1 or 2 pack Replaces the following part numbers: 3388651, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP Works for brand: Whirlpool, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Roper, Estate, Inglis, Crosley, Maytag, Amana, Admiral, Magic Chef. Fixes problem with: No heat or not enough heat.  Will Not Start.  Takes too long to dry. Shuts off too soon.  Timer will not advance.  Will not tumble.  Too hot.  Will not shut off. Touchpad does not respond. Contact Us If you are not sure if part is correct, ask us in Customer questions & answers section or contact us by visiting the Discount Parts Direct storefront. Business Wholesale We are a small local company from Houston, Texas offer discount parts for retail and wholesale. If you need to purchase parts for business , please contact us for lower rates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410MaAauwdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Discount Parts Direct","source_asin":"B07JQTW7NF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JQTW7NF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JQTW7NF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
