window.products.push({"id":89722,"name":"GE WE1M654 Timer Knob Dryer PS1482197 Unbreakable Part WE1M443 AP3995088 Replacement DBXR463ED1WW DBXR463EG1WW DBXR463EG6WW DHDSR46EG1WW DHDSR46EG7WW ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+VlpLxdoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Ge We1m654 Timer Knob Assembly For Dryer - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP3995088, 1264290, AH1482197, EA1482197, PS1482197, WE01M0443, WE1M443, WE1M502, WE1M668. Timer Knob We1m654 is compatible with Hotpoint, General Electric / GE dryer's. The knob is made of durable plastic material that resists cracking and breaking, and has a sturdy metal insert that ensures a tight and secure fit to the control shaft. It fits dozens of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the We1m654 Dryer Timer Knob? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Ge Dryer Knob Replacement We1m654 will help if your appliance timer does not advance, it does not start, shuts off too soon, does not shut off. Dryer Timer Knob We1m654 is designed to fit onto a D-shaped shaft with the help of a small retaining clip that keeps it in place. 💡 Ge Dryer Timer Knob We1m654 has a sleek design that complements the style of modern dryers, and is easy to install without any special tools. Ge Timer Knob We1m654 is a rotary control knob that is used to select different dryer cycles such as delicate, permanent press, and timed drying. Ge Dryer Knob We1m654 meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How do you fix a dryer timer knob? If the timer knob on a dryer is not working properly, it could be due to loose connections or damage. To fix it, start by checking for loose connections and securing them. Next, inspect the timer knob for damage or wear and clean it if necessary. If the knob is damaged, replace it by gently pulling off the old one and sliding a new one onto the control shaft. Test the dryer by turning the knob to different settings to ensure the dryer starts/stops correctly. 💡 Are the dryer knobs universal? Dryer knobs are not universal, and the specific knob required for a dryer will depend on the make and model of the appliance. It is important to find the correct replacement knob that is designed to fit your particular dryer model. It is important to ensure that the replacement knob matches the original knob in terms of shape, size, and function to ensure proper operation of the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+VlpLxdoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07J5FB4SY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J5FB4SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J5FB4SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
