window.products.push({"id":89802,"name":"Beaquicy WB44X5082 Oven Bake Element - Replacement for Hot-point G-E Oven - Replaces 3358, AP2031084, PS249466, EAP249466","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ezj5cewtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High temperature resistant nickel stainless steel ✅【PRODUCT DESCRIPTION】: The WB44X5082 Range Oven Bake Heating Element is located at the bottom of the oven and have screw-on terminals. Used to provide heat to the oven. The element has a rated power of 2700/1869W and a rated voltage of 250/208V. The dimensions from the bracket to the front of the element are: 17.75 inches wide x 17 inches long,and the terminal extending approximately 2.25 inches beyond the bracket. ✅【MATERIALS】: The WB44X5082 Oven Bake Element is made from high quality materials and rigorously manufactured to ensure a long service life.The two terminals and the small holder at the top are made of metal and have a nickel-plated surface for increased resistance to high temperatures and oxidation. The body of the element is made of high temperature resistant metal with good thermal conductivity and heat resistance. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】: The WB44X5082 Bake Element support 365 days return and exchange. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. If element is broken, the oven will have the following conditions, and the element need to be replaced in time: ★The oven not heating; ★Uneven heating; ★The heating element broke. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBILE】: The WB44X5082 Oven Bake Heating Element can fits for G-E, Hot-point, Ken-more oven.★WB44X5082 Replaces models: 8030, AP00328011, P328011, Q000211877, RP44X5082, TS44X5082, WB44X0192, WB44X10003, WB44X1126, WB44X192, WB44X5061, RB525J1, RB525J2, RB525J3, RB525J4, RB525N1, RB525N2, RB525N3, JBP90AS1, JBP90AS2, JBP90AV1, JBP90AV2, JBP90AW1, JBP90GS2, JBP90GV1, JBP90GV2, 1196457810, 1196458010, 1196458011, 1196467810, 1196468010, 1196468011, 1196477810, 1196478010, etc. ✅【BRING CONVENIENCE FOR YOUR LIFE】: The installation of WB44X5082 Range Oven Bake Element is simple. Before making repairs, disconnect the power and put on your work gloves. You only need to remove the two screws that connect the element to the oven. Gently pull out the old element, disconnect the wires connected to the element and remove the old element, replace it with the new one and install it in the reverse order. You can save money on replacing your oven or hiring a repairman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ezj5cewtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087M4QPS6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087M4QPS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087M4QPS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
