window.products.push({"id":89871,"name":"EUHOMY Ice Maker Machine Countertop, 26 lbs/24H, 9 Cubes Ready in 6 Mins, Self-Cleaning Electric Ice Maker Compact Potable Ice Maker with Ice Scoop an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71za0h02A5L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Euhomy - GIVE YOU THE BEST ICE - Euhomy's newly designed bullet-type countertop ice maker machine brings you a brand new ice cube experience. Our ice maker can produce about 26 pounds of ice per day, which can meet the needs of 1-2 people. Only 6 minutes can produce 9 pcs delicious ice cubes, you can do it anytime you want. Chewable ice cubes are perfect for Drinks/Food/Seafood/Smoothies. AUTO SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION - Daily cleaning can prevent the ice machine from producing scale and mold, which is one of the very important maintenance operations of the ice machine. Press the \"Select\" button of the ice maker to switch the mold to \"Clean\", and then press the \"On/Off\" button, the ice maker will perform a \"cleaning program\" through circulating water. Note: Make sure to clean the ice time before making the first ice. EVERYTHING IS TO MAKE YOU EASIER - Euhomy ice maker machine countertop is user-friendly without any installment. The compact ice maker has two ice cube size buttons, you can choose different sizes of ice cubes according to your needs by pressing the select button. The ice maker contains a removable ice basket and an ice scoop, which ease the way to remove the ice. You can place the portable ice maker countertop anywhere, perfect for any countertop/Kitchen/Living room/Bedroom/Office/Party. SUPER ICE-MAKING - Euhomy's counter ice maker machine is equipped with a high-efficiency compressor, which not only has an excellent cooling effect but also has a good performance in the noise during the ice-making process. All this allows you to enjoy ice cubes and drinks in a quiet environment. Not only do the characteristics of the ice maker compressor make the ice maker low energy consumption, but also the desktop ice maker has a circulating water tank, which will not cause water waste. ONE YEAR WARRANTY & GIFT-PACKAGE- EUHOMY offers a 12-month warranty and support for ice makers. Customer satisfaction is our first consideration. Moreover, the well-designed package of sonic ice maker can be the choice of gift for others. Each countertop ice maker is equipped with an ice basket and an ice shovel. Make sure that these accessories are present when you receive the goods, and if there are any missing, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71za0h02A5L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B09D746441","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D746441","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D746441","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
