window.products.push({"id":89971,"name":"MAXX COLD MXSH23.6SHC S-Series Refrigeration Chest Freezer, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1679.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vK0dzQETL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Maxx Cold Select Series unit is excellent for safely storing frozen foods. The garage ready large chest freezer perfect for commercial as well as residential use: Convenience stores, Grocery stores, Concession stands, Ice cream shops, Restaurants, Bars & entertainment venues, Homes & households, and Garages & basements. The deep freezer keeps frozen food product at the ideal storage temperature to maintain quality, taste and extends product life. Ideal for storage of: Meat, Packaged foods, Ice cream & Gelato, Vegetables, Desserts, and Bags of ice. Also, the storage space on this unit is optimal so the extra large chest freezer 23.6 Cu ft. provides plenty of space for storing food items. The frost free chest freezer prevents freezer burn as well as the development of ice crystals. Additionally, the double top lid design on this model makes frozen food product easily accessible when it’s time to use. Furthermore, the unit comes equipped with multiple interior storage baskets. Their design helps you organize your products. The baskets allows to quickly locate and retrieve what you need. Maxx Cold MXSH23.6SHC Extra Large Chest Freezer with 23.6 Cu ft. Storage Additional Features a solid hinged lid. Engineered with an oversized refrigeration system (large storage space). The large chest freezer unit is easy to install. Safe to use in a garage even if the temperature drops to 0 degrees F or rises above 100 degrees F. A hinged lid which includes a lock and key prevents unauthorized access to the contents. The freezer's size allows to pull down its content temperature level if loaded with pre-chilled products. The large storage deep freezer provides years of reliable operation when properly maintained and the white coated exterior is easy to wipe down and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vK0dzQETL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXX Cold","source_asin":"B07BVBVF7D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-89971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BVBVF7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BVBVF7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
